Third-party content that ships inside the Hejmo binary or its web interface:

GeoNames place list (data, CC BY 4.0, embedded in the binary)
  internal/places/data/places.tsv.gz
  Contains data from GeoNames (https://www.geonames.org), licensed CC BY 4.0,
  extract of 2026-11-15, filtered to DE/AT/CH and reformatted.
  Licence: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/
  Attribution file: internal/places/data/LICENSE-GeoNames.txt
  Also named on the licences page of the web interface (Settings -> Licences).

Figtree typeface (font, SIL Open Font License 1.1)
  web/static/fonts/Figtree-wght.ttf, licence: web/static/fonts/OFL.txt

BLS 4.0 food data (data, CC BY 4.0, embedded in the binary)
  internal/nutrition/data/foods.tsv.gz (the BLS foods; see also the USDA entry below)
  Contains data from the Bundeslebensmittelschlüssel (BLS), Version 4.0, German Nutrient Database:
  Max Rubner-Institut (2025): Bundeslebensmittelschlüssel (BLS), Version 4.0 - Deutsche Nährstoffdatenbank.
  Karlsruhe. DOI: 10.25826/Data20251217-134202-0. Publisher: Max Rubner-Institut (MRI), https://blsdb.de
  Licence: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/
  Changes: reduced to the seven values of the EU nutrition declaration per 100 g and the names (tools/foodlist).
  Attribution file: internal/nutrition/data/LICENSE-Nutrition.txt
  Also named on the licences page of the web interface (Settings -> Licences) and at every recipe that shows values.

USDA FoodData Central food data (data, CC0 1.0, embedded in the binary)
  internal/nutrition/data/foods.tsv.gz (the USDA foods: Foundation Foods 2026-10-29, SR Legacy 2018-04)
  U.S. Department of Agriculture, Agricultural Research Service. FoodData Central, https://fdc.nal.usda.gov
  Licence: https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/ (no attribution required; given anyway)
  Changes: reduced to the same seven values and the names (tools/foodlist).

nyaruka/phonenumbers (Go library, MIT, linked into the Hejmo binary)
  Go port of Google's libphonenumber by Nyaruka; its number plans are Google's libphonenumber metadata
  (Apache License 2.0). Reads, checks and normalises phone numbers (ADR 0026). No network connections.
  Licence: https://github.com/nyaruka/phonenumbers/blob/master/LICENSE
  Also named on the licences page of the web interface (Settings -> Licences).

Religious holidays calendar (ticket 339): Go libraries linked into the Hejmo binary, and date tables embedded in it
  hebcal/hebcal-go (GPL-2.0-or-later) with hebcal/hdate and hebcal/greg (GPL-2.0-or-later), hebcal/noaa-go (LGPL-2.1),
    hebcal/locales and hebcal/gematriya (BSD-2-Clause): the Hebrew calendar, Diaspora schedule. https://github.com/hebcal/hebcal-go
    GPL-2.0-or-later is compatible with the AGPL-3.0 of Hejmo. No network connections.
  hablullah/go-hijri and hablullah/go-juliandays (MIT): the Umm al-Qura calendar. https://github.com/hablullah/go-hijri
  soniakeys/meeus/v3 and soniakeys/unit (MIT): sun, moon, equinox and Easter (after Jean Meeus, Astronomical Algorithms).
    https://github.com/soniakeys/meeus
  Tables (internal/religiousholiday): the Diyanet table of religious days 2020-2030, Losar, the SGPC Nanakshahi Jantri. Every entry
    names its source; entries not yet checked against it are marked, in the code and on the licences page.
  All named on the licences page of the web interface (Settings -> Licences).
